 "confidence": "high",
 "notes": "50 states + DC + USPS territories AS, GU, MP, PR, VI (ISO US- outlying-area codes). US-UM is left out: USPS has no UM code and no delivery. Non-ISO codes, justified by USPS Publication 28 (they are written in the state slot): US-AA/US-AE/US-AP (Armed Forces Americas/Europe/Pacific) and US-FM/US-MH/US-PW (freely associated states served by USPS; ISO treats them as countries FM/MH/PW, so no US- code exists)."
